From 17f2ba8142e0da9926c404e6f9ed07bdc94cfb49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaroslav Hryhorenko <yarik13371337@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Build cyclictest and the libraries on QNX 8.0

QNX has no SCHED_DEADLINE (sched_setattr/getattr return ENOSYS), no
RLIMIT_RTPRIO, /proc/loadavg, /proc/cpuinfo or /dev/cpu_dma_latency, and no
getcpu(). SIGEV_THREAD_ID maps to SIGEV_SIGNAL_THREAD, SCHED_OTHER runs at
priority 10 as there is no priority 0, and pip_stress passes -1 as the file
descriptor of its anonymous mapping, which QNX requires.
---
 src/cyclictest/cyclictest.c           | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/include/rt-get_cpu.h              |  4 +--
 src/lib/rt-get_cpu.c                  |  4 +--
 src/lib/rt-sched.c                    | 17 ++++++++++++
 src/lib/rt-utils.c                    |  2 ++
 src/pi_tests/pip_stress.c             |  2 +-
 src/rt-migrate-test/rt-migrate-test.c |  4 +++
 7 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/cyclictest/cyclictest.c b/src/cyclictest/cyclictest.c
index 58b56bc..5b6dd19 100644
--- a/src/cyclictest/cyclictest.c
+++ b/src/cyclictest/cyclictest.c
@@ -57,7 +57,9 @@
